  "solution": "Mặt phẳng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> có phương trình\n\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên véc-tơ pháp tuyến của mặt phẳng là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover><mi>n</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tĐường thẳng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>d</mi></semantics></math> song song với mặt phẳng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>, gọi véc-tơ chỉ phương của <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>d</mi></semantics></math> là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mi>u</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>. Vì <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>∥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> suy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mi>u</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mover><mi>n</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tKhoảng cách ngắn nhất từ điểm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math> đến đường thẳng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>d</mi></semantics></math> là khoảng cách từ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math> đến mặt phẳng đi qua <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> và song song với mặt phẳng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tGọi mặt phẳng này là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>. Phương trình của mặt phẳng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> có dạng\n\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tMặt phẳng này đi qua điểm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>, nên tọa độ của <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> phải thỏa mãn phương trình của <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>. Thay tọa độ của <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> vào\n\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tVậy phương trình của mặt phẳng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> là\n\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tTa có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tĐường thẳng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>d</mi></semantics></math> đi qua điểm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> và có véc-tơ chỉ phương <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mover><mi>u</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math>.<br> \n\t\tTa chọn véc-tơ chỉ phương của <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>d</mi></semantics></math> là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐮</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tVậy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.",
